{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-4","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与整数","englishTitle":"If a cube number by multiplying a cube number make some number, the product will be cube.","book":9,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","contentId":"euclid-9-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"217d6e6b17943f815d0a9f23ade59687d014f0e05fe97a73ccaa4de3c0ac7b12","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-4.statement","euclid-9-4.construction.1","euclid-9-4.construction.2","euclid-9-4.proof.1","euclid-9-4.proof.2","euclid-9-4.proof.3","euclid-9-4.conclusion","euclid-9-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84d097ca84b77c81c0d397d8507e677e811a387ab45afe8c3b4f7ef94f424508","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a cube number by multiplying a cube number make some number, the product will be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果立方数乘以立方数 得出一个数字, 产品将是立方体 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f4c19d28b8f06ba6c16044138b1f61f8eab3f230732bcefda3dff64d081f549","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the cube number A by multiplying the cube number B make C; I say that C is cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将立方数 A乘以立方数 B乘以C; 我说C是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-4.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34c96e8c74cc506f92247d666cc04217adbb15587b77f0a0e874ab7a531dafc3","citations":["euclid-9-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A by multiplying itself make D; therefore D is cube. [[IX. 3](/principles/euclid-9-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以乘以D,D是立方体。 [[IX. 3](/principles/euclid-9-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa341e81fd2dff9c57e2c70f5d41ab7a194a7b869d01d4244108ce7adfcd465a","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A by multiplying itself has made D, and by multiplying B has made C therefore, as A is to B, so is D to C. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自A乘以D,乘以B,乘以C,A比B等于D比C；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 C 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"70a902a40b36e54f3bf8978cdd64156b423343c127d189cf2bbfb29c76658099","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A, B are cube numbers, A, B are similar solid numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B是立方数,A,B是相似立体数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25acd5d933463384aeec5dc77de3bc78dbbcb39ece3e7358e69da487f5505095","citations":["euclid-8-19","euclid-8-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two mean proportional numbers fall between A, B; [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)] so that two mean proportional numbers will fall between D, C also. [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,2 比例中项个数字在A和B之间,2 比例中项个数字也将在D C之间。 [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)] [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bdd8cae2095112bd346a7a9ae9658c8c8470b4cb300259bac16e3245fe77a3ae","citations":["euclid-8-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And D is cube; therefore C is also cube [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D是立方体,C也是立方体Q. E. D。 [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-4.source","contentId":"euclid-9-4","revisionId":"euclid-9-4@raw-217d6e6b17943f81","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c025785db9f2c3da0132286d1db5b3c105cbe3c007791295f27c7ad6a9aaf208"